[00:00.00] 作词 : Roger Waters
[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:00.00] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[00:14.21]If you didn't care what happened to me,
[00:14.21]如果你不关心发生在我身上的事
[00:29.22]And I didn't care for you
[00:29.22]我也不会关心你了
[00:44.38]We would zigzag our way
[00:44.38]我们就各走各的路吧
[00:48.65]through the boredom and pain
[00:48.65]穿越各自的烦恼和苦痛
[00:52.86]Occasionally glancing up through the rain
[00:52.86]间或抬眼凝视下雨的天空
[01:01.26]Wondering which of the buggers to blame
[01:01.26]想弄清哪些家伙难辞其咎
[01:11.14]And watching for pigs on the wing.
[01:11.14]眼见猪群扑腾翅膀飞过
